00:20:43.576 --> 00:20:46.535
This is one we did yesterday.
This is like the end.


00:21:11.812 --> 00:21:14.896
So each hero moment,
we do something like that, cool.


00:21:26.035 --> 00:21:28.305
There's a moment here
