00:22:51.662 --> 00:22:52.948
Why does A4 not work?


00:22:54.290 --> 00:22:56.031
Don't question the system.


00:22:57.626 --> 00:23:00.289
This is my nemesis,
this copy machine.


00:23:09.346 --> 00:23:10.553
It's upside down.


00:23:15.519 --> 00:23:18.227
He is one of the few people
