- Yes, on my special paper.


00:23:41.837 --> 00:23:44.250
How long have you
used this process, David?


00:23:44.882 --> 00:23:46.151
Since the very beginning.


00:23:46.175 --> 00:23:49.043
- Did someone teach you...?
- I taught myself.


00:23:49.136 --> 00:23:51.048
This is my method.


00:23:51.138 --> 00:23:52.379
My methodology.


00:23:52.473 --> 00:23:55.432
My stuff goes in that safe there,
so nothing gets left out.


00:23:55.517 --> 00:23:57.133
If you touch the paper
at the wrong time,


00:23:57.227 --> 00:24:00.891
